# Synthetic assembly rule shared by the Nangate RCX and GT2N PSM tests.
# Format reused from src/rcx/src/interChipModel.cpp.

# One limitation: the current code accepts one HBV resistance and
# applies it to every connection bond it models
# It does not support a different resistance for each individual bond.

# That limitation was already in the existing RCX code file -
# src/rcx/src/interChipModel.cpp: parseInterChipRules stops after the first HBV.

VIA_RESISTANCE
HBV 0.1
END
